WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.344
Welcome to the Community Welcome Screen — a configurable animated welcome display for community events and workshops.

2
00:00:07.344 --> 00:00:14.377
The default SpaceXAI theme shows a large animated wordmark, live date, and floating particle background.

3
00:00:14.377 --> 00:00:20.328
On first visit, a one-time Rive loading intro plays before the welcome stage takes over.

4
00:00:20.328 --> 00:00:26.304
Turn on bot avatars in the editor to float playful clay-style characters behind the welcome stage.

5
00:00:26.304 --> 00:00:32.304
Press E or click Edit to open the sidebar editor and customize content without touching code.

6
00:00:32.304 --> 00:00:45.336
The editor lets you toggle SpaceXAI branding, set brand and title, choose auto or custom dates, configure animation replay intervals from five to sixty seconds, and add up to five sponsor entries.

7
00:00:45.336 --> 00:00:53.784
Press T or flip the SpaceXAI branding switch to swap between the SpaceXAI monochrome look and the classic Cursor orange-accent theme.

8
00:00:53.784 --> 00:01:01.248
The Cursor theme restores the original animated SVG logo, accent styling, and community workshop copy.

9
00:01:01.248 --> 00:01:09.144
Additional Details in the editor supports up to five sponsor entries, each with a title and name displayed on the welcome stage.

10
00:01:09.144 --> 00:01:15.648
Share copies a URL with your full configuration encoded so others see your exact welcome screen setup.

11
00:01:15.648 --> 00:01:23.280
The Grok Bot screen is a dedicated welcome experience with colorful blob characters that track your cursor across the stage.

12
00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:30.264
On the Grok Bot screen, extra characters can be toggled in the editor to float additional blob bots around the stage.

13
00:01:30.264 --> 00:01:37.248
Jump between the main welcome screen and the Grok Bot experience anytime using the Grok Bot button in the top-right actions.
